{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"先前的亲近确实给过他满足。这一次，他更信任自己的渴望，投入时也比从前少些拘束。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始更自然、更充分地投入亲近，也更信任自己的渴望。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这条解释把更深的投入归因于亲近曾带来的真实满足，既承接前史，也能说明这次的欢喜为何比初次更充实。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选3\",\n        \"候选6\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"旧日适可而止的习惯仍在。如今他越在意亲近能否延续，心里越急切，渴望也越难收回。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始感到，想让亲近延续的心愿会冲击自己熟悉的掌控感。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这条解释把急切归因于旧有的掌控习惯与日渐在意的亲近之间的冲突，与前一种因满足而增长信任的解释有实质区别。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选7\",\n        \"候选15\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "18b595d7-291a-42d1-9a23-dad4270c4dbd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T015816475915Z", "elapsed_seconds": 116.906, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:00:13.396689+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "60cf686e30d4bcd273a6dc48fbc33711369fc4df438f73f769787b676f983d0e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf3105